## Patrón SQL embebido (Trámites 2.0)

```
Migrations/
  20260610180000_AddIdentityGlobalAuthSettings.cs      # Up/Down → SqlMigrationHelper
  20260610180000_AddIdentityGlobalAuthSettings.Designer.cs  # OBLIGATORIO
  Sql/Tramites20/GlobalAuthSettings_up.sql             # EmbeddedResource
```

Ver `services/core-api/src/Flit.Infrastructure/Migrations/Sql/Tramites20/README.md`.

